## 4. Prometheus 告警规则

```yaml
# prometheus/rules/gorm.yml
groups:
  - name: gorm_database
    rules:
      # 慢查询率告警
      - alert: HighSlowQueryRate
        expr: rate(mysql_global_status_slow_queries[5m]) > 10
